  "bio": "Goldy Z is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in black&gray and dotwork styles, and co-owner of the famous @dot.creativegroup based in New York. His artistry has earned him roughly 220,000 followers on Instagram, showcasing his remarkable talent to a vast audience. He combines his refined skills with a deep sense of professionalism, thus he kindly requests not to receive work affairs via DMs. His work reflects the pulse and grit of NYC, admired and worn by many.\nPrice: $$$\nCurrent location: New York, New York, United States\n\nStudio @dot.creativegroup , New York City \nNo work DMs please, all inquiries through the link below\nBoulder, CO March 23-27",
